{"id":"1c5e73270aea4f93","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-usl.md","title":"上半格的结构签名","display":"df-usl — 上半格的结构签名","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-usl","aliases":["20-df-usl"],"display":"df-usl — 上半格的结构签名","chapter":"3","section":"3.4","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§3.4 的 upper semilattice；结构定义的本地展开","source_pdf_pages":[96],"source_printed_pages":[60],"depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-usl"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-usl</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-usl — 上半格的结构签名"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§3.4 的 upper semilattice；结构定义的本地展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>96</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>60</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 为非空集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_P\\subseteq P^2\">\\(\\le_P\\subseteq P^2\\)</span> 为偏序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}usl}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{USL}(P,\\le_P)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall a,b\\in P\\ \\exists c\\in P\\\n[a\\le_Pc\\land b\\le_Pc\\land\\forall d\\in P\\\n((a\\le_Pd\\land b\\le_Pd)\\Rightarrow c\\le_Pd)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}usl}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{USL}(P,\\le_P)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall a,b\\in P\\ \\exists c\\in P\\\n[a\\le_Pc\\land b\\le_Pc\\land\\forall d\\in P\\\n((a\\le_Pd\\land b\\le_Pd)\\Rightarrow c\\le_Pd)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>偏序要求自反、反对称、传递。这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 唯一，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\vee_Pb\">\\(a\\vee_Pb\\)</span>。结构的载体与顺序都必须提供；不把所有上半格默认解释为 Turing 度结构。</p>\n<p>来源：§3.4 的 upper semilattice；结构定义的本地展开；印刷页 60；PDF 第 96 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_P\\subseteq P^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}usl}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{USL}(P,\\le_P)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall a,b\\in P\\ \\exists c\\in P\\\n[a\\le_Pc\\land b\\le_Pc\\land\\forall d\\in P\\\n((a\\le_Pd\\land b\\le_Pd)\\Rightarrow c\\le_Pd)].","display":true},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"a\\vee_Pb","display":false}],"bytes":1078,"backlinks":[{"id":"add061435570e03f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-exact-pair]]；see [[20-df-usl]]。"},{"id":"cc0aeae8dce11855","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-df-usl]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}